# a text spells an int up to 64 bits, both ends included; past them a loud error, never a wrapped value (user 11-11, card int-text-overflow)
'"9223372036854775807" as int'	9223372036854775807
'("9223372036854775807" as int) is int'	yes
'("-9223372036854775808" as int) is int'	yes
'"9223372036854775808" as int'	error	a text spells an int only up to 64 bits
'"-9223372036854775809" as int'	error	a text spells an int only up to 64 bits
'int("1267650600228229401496703205376")'	error	a text spells an int only up to 64 bits
